{"step_index":109,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:29:02Z","content":"I have created a complete **Telegram Game Bot & Mini App** with a catalog of **1,000 games** modeled after **Gamee**.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 What Has Been Built\n\n1. **🎮 1,000+ Curated Games Database** ([`games.json`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/data/games.json)):\n   - **🕹️ Arcade (130 games):** Brick Breakers, Neon Runners, Pinball, Bounce Ball, Orbit Dodge, etc.\n   - **🧩 Puzzle (130 games):** 2048 Neon, Sudoku, Block Collapse, Water Sort, Match 3, Brain Out, etc.\n   - **⚔️ Action (130 games):** Space Blaster, Galaxy Defender, Alien Swarm, Shadow Knight, etc.\n   - **🏎️ Racing (125 games):** Turbo Drift, Moto Extreme, Highway Speed, Formula Dash, Kart Mania, etc.\n   - **⚽ Sports (125 games):** Neon Pong, Penalty Kick, Basketball Slam, 8 Ball Pool, Bowling, etc.\n   - **👾 Retro (120 games):** Retro Snake 97, Space Invaders 80s, Pong 1972, Tetromino Classic, etc.\n   - **🃏 Cards & Board (120 games):** Tic Tac Toe Cyber, Solitaire, Chess 3D, Checkers, Uno Party, etc.\n   - **🎯 Casual (120 games):** Flappy Wing 2.0, Tower Stack 3D, Speed Tap Frenzy, Fruit Slicer, etc.\n\n2. **⚡ Instant Built-in Playable HTML5 Canvas Games:**\n   - **2048 Neon Deluxe** ([`2048/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/2048/index.html)) – Swipe/arrow key tile merging with neon animations.\n   - **Flappy Wing 2.0** ([`flappy/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/flappy/index.html)) – Tap-to-flap physics, pipe collisions, score tracking.\n   - **Retro Snake 97** ([`snake/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/snake/index.html)) – Classic Nokia 90s grid snake with on-screen D-pad.\n   - **Neon Pong Arena** ([`pong/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/pong/index.html)) – Smooth touch paddle tennis vs intelligent AI bot.\n   - **Space Blaster 3000** ([`space_blaster/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/space_blaster/index.html)) – Ship controls, laser auto-fire, waves of alien targets & particle explosions.\n   - **Tetris Block Master** ([`tetris/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/tetris/index.html)) – Falling tetrominoes, rotation, line sweeps & combos.\n   - **Memory Matrix Flip** ([`memory/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/memory/index.html)) – Glowing cyber card flip matching with timer and move tracker.\n   - **Tic Tac Toe Cyber** ([`tictactoe/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/tictactoe/index.html)) – Glow grid with Minimax AI.\n   - **Tower Stack 3D** ([`tower_stack/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/tower_stack/index.html)) – Precision timing skyscraper stacker with dynamic block slicing.\n   - **Speed Tap Frenzy** ([`speed_clicker/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/speed_clicker/index.html)) – 15-second reflex frenzy clicker.\n   - **Universal Web Runner** ([`web_runner/index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/web_runner/index.html)) – Dynamic arcade runner engine for the remaining catalog games.\n\n3. **📱 Telegram Mini App (Web App Frontend):**\n   - Located at [`index.html`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/index.html), [`style.css`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/css/style.css), and [`app.js`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/js/app.js).\n   - Real-time search across all 1,000 games.\n   - Category filtering & virtual batch loading for smooth 60fps mobile performance.\n   - Automatic score synchronization from games to the backend.\n   - Global Leaderboard and Personal Favorites/Bookmarks.\n\n4. **🤖 Telegram Bot (Aiogram 3 backend):**\n   - [`handlers.py`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/bot/handlers.py) & [`keyboards.py`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/bot/keyboards.py):\n     - `/start`: Interactive welcome menu with the direct **\"⚡ PLAY 1,000+ GAMES 🎮\"** Mini App button.\n     - `/games`: Category browser with paginated game lists.\n     - `/search <query>`: Instant in-chat game lookup.\n     - `/random`: Random game launcher.\n     - `/leaderboard`: Global rankings & top scores.\n     - `/profile`: Player stats, total points, and personal bests.\n     - **Inline Mode (`@bot_username <game>`):** Search and share games with friends in **any group or private chat** just like Gamee!\n\n5. **🗄️ Database & Backend Server:**\n   - [`database.py`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/database.py): Async SQLite database storing user stats, score history, favorites, and game high scores.\n   - [`server.py`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/server.py): FastAPI server providing high-performance REST APIs and static file delivery.\n   - [`main.py`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/main.py): Unified runner that launches both the FastAPI web server and Telegram Bot concurrently.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to Run & Connect to Telegram\n\n#### Step 1: Create your Bot in Telegram\n1. Open [@BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather) on Telegram.\n2. Send `/newbot`, name your bot, and copy the **Bot Token**.\n3. Send `/setinline` to `@BotFather` to enable inline sharing in groups.\n\n#### Step 2: Configure your Token\nEdit [`.env`](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/.env):\n```env\nBOT_TOKEN=your_token_from_botfather\nBOT_USERNAME=your_bot_username_without_at\nWEBAPP_URL=https://your-domain-or-tunnel-url.com\nSERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0\nSERVER_PORT=8080\n```\n\n> **Note on HTTPS:** Telegram Mini Apps require an HTTPS URL. For local testing, you can expose port `8080` using a free tunnel like `cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8080` or `ngrok http 8080`, and paste the generated HTTPS URL into `WEBAPP_URL`.\n\n#### Step 3: Start the Bot & Server\n```bash\nsource /root/venv/bin/activate\ncd /root/telegram_game_bot\npython main.py\n```\n\nRefer to the complete guide in [README.md](file:///root/telegram_game_bot/README.md) for background systemd deployment and advanced options."}
